== WHAT THIS LOG IS FOR, AND WHAT A RECAPTURE MUST KEEP ==
   evidence.py#_ENVIRONMENTAL_GRAMMARS names THIS log, by name, as the live
   corpus witness for planning_root and archive_root. Being that witness is
   its whole job. The sweep in test_evidence.py#_corpus_witness_fields_by_log
   applies this log's OWN volatile declarations to this log's OWN body and
   asks whether a token of each shape is erased -- so the two roster lines
   under THE TWO WITNESS LINES below ARE those tokens, and the two matching
   '# evidence-volatile:' lines in the header are what erases them.
   RECAPTURING THIS LOG MUST KEEP BOTH, header and body. Drop either and
   test_evidence.py#test_every_declared_grammar_has_a_live_witness turns red.
   That is the whole of the obligation; nothing else in this body is load-
   bearing, and no count, percentage or population is printed on purpose.

== WHY THE WITNESS IS ITS OWN LOG (concern C-103) ==
   These two grammars used to cite evidence/casting-10-blast-radius.log,
   whose job is the opposite of this one's: it is deliberately WIDE, it
   drives four peer-owned modules, and the standing derived-verdict ruling
   tells a log like that to stop printing its population and print a verdict.
   Applied literally to that log, the ruling deletes the skip roster -- and
   with it both witness tokens -- turning a casting-5 test red from a
   casting-10 commit, with nothing in the log, the ruling or the recapture
   instructions saying so. A witness wants to be narrow and stable; a
   blast-radius log wants to be wide and derived. One log cannot be both, so
   the roles are split here and the witness now lives in a log owned by the
   same casting as the registry that names it.

== THE OBSERVATION, WHICH IS REAL AND NOT ECHOED ==
   Both shapes are printed by pytest itself. foundry-archive/ and .planning/
   are git-ignored, so the artefacts those two skips look for are absent in
   every detached worktree a sweep re-executes in, and each skip message
   names the worktree it looked in -- which is exactly the environmental
   variation the two grammars license, appearing on every honest
   verification and never on a forged one. The lines below are pytest's own
   skip reports, module and message, sibling line numbers stripped because a
   line number is another casting's and carries no witness.

