   tests/test_measure_run.py  grand-vulture archive not present in this checkout: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-rayjanoka-ab-code-guild/cd0df849-d938-48c1-bffe-69a071468853/scratchpad/c5wt/foundry-archive/grand-vulture (foundry-archive/ is git-ignored)

